  172                /       P?S/8 SIX-BIT OUTPUT ROUTINE.
  173   
  174                /       CALL WITH:
  175   
  176                /       TAD     CHAR            /AC CONTAINS LATEST CHARACTER TO OUTPUT
  177                /       JMS I   (P6CH)          /CALL ROUTINE
  178                /       ALWAYS RETURNS HERE WITH CLEAR AC
  179                /       FILES ARE AUTOMATICALLY CREATED AS NECESSARY.
  180   
  181                /       CALL APPROPRIATE ROUTINE TO CLOSE THE FILE (NL4000;JMS I POUT).
  182   
  183                /       THE CONVERSION PROCESS STARTS AT "MEMIN" WHICH OPENS THE FIRST FILE.
  184   
  185   00257  0400  P6CH,   NEWBUFFER               /SIX-BIT OUTPUT ROUTINE; PRELOADED FOR STARTUP
  186   00260  4772          JMS I   (PFFOUT)        /CALL P?S/8 OUTPUT ROUTINE
  187   00261  7410          SKP                     /SKIP IF FILE JUST CLOSED
  188   00262  5274          JMP     P6END           /JUMP IF NOT
  189   00263  2001          ISZ     FILPTR          /BUMP TO NEXT FILE ARGUMENT
  190   00264  1401  MEMIN,  TAD I   FILPTR          /GET THE NEXT FILE ARGUMENT
  191   00265  7450          SNA                     /END OF ALL FILES?
  192   00266  5276          JMP     TRUNCATE        /YES, WE LOSE
  193   00267  3271          DCA     POFBLK          /NO, STORE IN-LINE
  194   00270  4771          JMS I   (PFFINITIALIZE) /CALL INITIALIZE ROUTINE
  195   00271  0000  POFBLK, .-.                     /WILL BE FILE ARGUMENT ([BLOCK&7770] + [UNIT&7])
