  352                /       P?S/8 FIXED FILE OUTPUT ROUTINE.
  353   
  354                /       CALL WITH:
  355   
  356                /       TAD     CHAR                    /AC CONTAINS LATEST CHARACTER TO OUTPUT
  357                /       JMS I   (PFFOUT)                /CALL ROUTINE
  358                /       JMP     FILEFULL                /THE FILE BECAME FULL AND WAS CLOSED OUT
  359                /       JMP     FILEOK                  /FILE IS STILL ACTIVE
  360   
  361                /       FILES WILL BE CLOSED OUT IF:
  362   
  363                /       A)      A NON-<EOL> IS PASSED AND THERE IS ONLY ROOM ENOUGH FOR THE
  364                /               NON-<EOL> CHARACTER AND AN ADDITIONAL <EOL> CHARACTER AND <EOF>.
  365                /               AN <EOL> WILL BE AUTOMATICALLY INSERTED TO PRESERVE THE INTEGRITY
  366                /               OF THE FILE ALONG WITH AN <EOF> TO CLOSE IT. THE FILE WILL ALSO
  367                /               BE WRITTEN OUT TO THE SYSTEM DEVICE ACCORDING TO THE PRIOR
  368                /               INITIALIZATION (SEE "PFFINIT").
  369   
  370                /       B)      AN <EOL> CHARACTER (0000) IS PASSED AND THERE IS LESS ROOM THAN
  371                /               "EOLPROT" LEFT IN THE FILE. AN <EOF> WILL BE INSERTED INTO THE FILE
  372                /               AND IT WILL BE CLOSED AND WRITTEN OUT TO THE SYSTEM DEVICE ACCORDING
  373                /               TO THE PRIOR INITIALIZATION (SEE "PFFINIT").
  374   
  375                /       C)      AN <EOF> CHARACTER (4000) IS PASSED. IF THE PREVIOUS CHARACTER WAS
  376                /               NOT AN <EOL> CHARACTER, ONE WILL BE INSERTED BEFORE AN <EOF> IS
  377                /               INSERTED. THE FILE WILL BE CLOSED AND WRITTEN OUT TO THE SYSTEM
  378                /               DEVICE ACCORDING TO THE PRIOR INITIALIZATION (SEE "PFFINIT").
  379   
  380   00600  0000  PFFOUT, .-.                             /FIXED FILE OUTPUT ROUTINE
  381   00601  3012          DCA     PFFLATEST               /SAVE LATEST CHARACTER
  382   00602  1012          TAD     PFFLATEST               /GET IT BACK
  383   00603  7450          SNA                             /IS IT <EOL>?
  384   00604  5222          JMP     PFFEOL                  /YES
